ller vs. Arizona","description":"In a back-and-forth thriller, Utah rallied to remain undefeated after Devon Dampier hit Creed Whittemore on a 70-yard score late in a 40-39 win over Arizona.","published":"2026-11-15T14:23:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50488650/no-2-utah-survives-late-70-yard-td-thriller-vs-arizona","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Patience starting to run thin for head coaches in Week 11","description":"Saturday didn't offer much to change the season's complexion, but some coaches are coming under pressure.","published":"2026-11-15T08:17:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal111426/week-11-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-15T07:48:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions111426/cfp-predictions-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kiffin understands frustration as LSU's playoff hopes dashed","description":"LSU coach Lane Kiffin said it was fair to question the team's 6-4 record this season after losing to Texas on Saturday, a defeat that likely knocked LSU out of playoff contention.","published":"2026-11-15T08:55:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50488081/kiffin-understands-frustration-lsu-playoff-hopes-dashed","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Arch Manning leads game-winning drive as Texas stuns LSU","description":"Arch Manning found Raleek Brown for a 4-yard touchdown pass along the left sideline with 3 seconds left as Texas escaped Tiger Stadium with a victory over LSU","published":"2026-11-15T13:13:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50487515/arch-manning-leads-game-winning-drive-texas-stuns-lsu","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest's post-blowout jab at SMU tops college football Week 11 trolls","description":"Wake Forest dominated SMU on the gridiron Saturday -- and added insult to injury after the game.","published":"2026-11-15T05:30:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481104/college-football-trolls-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-15T04:25:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Louisville's win vs. UNC ends in brawl as Belichick helps restore order on field","description":"Louisville's 16-14 win at North Carolina ended with punches thrown and players spilling onto the field, prompting Bill Belichick to help pull players from the melee.","published":"2026-11-15T14:18:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486992/louisville-holds-unc-game-ends-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kentucky's CFP hopes take hit in upset loss to Gators, Philo","description":"Florida quarterback Aaron Philo had 221 all-purpose yards and a touchdown to rally the Gators past No. 11 Kentucky 21-14 Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T08:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486400/kentucky-cfp-hopes-take-hit-upset-loss-gators-philo","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079518/jaylen-mcclain","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaylen_McClain"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jaylen McClain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaylen_McClain","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:23Z","intro":"Jaylen McClain (born June 24, 2006) is an American football safety for the Ohio State Buckeyes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"McClain attended high school at Seton Hall Preparatory School located in Essex County, New Jersey. During his junior season, he notched 83 tackles along with two interception, while also scoring an offensive touchdown. Coming out of high school, McClain was rated as a four-star recruit, the 22nd overall safety, and the 243 overall player in the class of 2024, where he committed to play college football for the Ohio State Buckeyes over offers from other schools such as Georgia, Michigan, Michigan State, Notre Dame, Oregon, Rutgers, Penn State, Stanford, Tennessee, and USC."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"During his true freshman season in 2024, he played in all 15 games, notching 15 tackles. Heading into the 2025 season, McClain competed with Malik Hartford for a starting spot in the Buckeyes secondary. Ultimately, he would beat out Hartford, and become the team's starting safety besides Caleb Downs. In week one of the 2025 season, McClain notched eight tackles in a victory over the #1 ranked Texas Longhorns. In week three, he notched a pass deflection, in a 37-9 victory over Ohio."}]}}